WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,800
A group of six people is correct

2
00:00:01,800 --> 00:00:03,400
At least there must be a group of six people

3
00:00:03,400 --> 00:00:05,400
It is said that there is a child Liu San inside

4
00:00:05,400 --> 00:00:06,400
you come with me

5
00:00:06,400 --> 00:00:15,820
Riding an iron horse to pick them up right away so you can hold on a little longer

6
00:00:18,020 --> 00:00:21,020
That's going to hurt you. You go away and don't worry about us, dad.

7
00:00:21,020 --> 00:00:22,620
We have to go together, we have two children.

8
00:00:22,620 --> 00:00:23,820
You have to take them back

9
00:00:23,820 --> 00:00:26,420
I've lived with your mother for most of my life, that's enough, Dad

10
00:00:27,110 --> 00:00:28,710
Someone knows we're here

11
00:00:28,710 --> 00:00:29,710
Maybe Shazhou City

12
00:00:29,710 --> 00:00:31,110
Someone will be sent out to pick us up

13
00:00:31,110 --> 00:00:32,110
They're not around right now

14
00:00:32,110 --> 00:00:33,710
Recruit thirteen refugees there?

15
00:00:33,710 --> 00:00:35,710
Maybe he will send someone to pick us up.

16
00:00:35,710 --> 00:00:36,910
Silly boy

17
00:00:36,910 --> 00:00:38,910
Shazhou City has been besieged for three months.

18
00:00:38,910 --> 00:00:40,910
There's not even a standing horse in it.

19
00:00:40,910 --> 00:00:42,510
Why did he come to pick us up?

20
00:00:42,510 --> 00:00:45,710
They themselves are just afraid that they will have no food now and ask him to come and pick us up.

21
00:00:45,710 --> 00:00:47,110
Doesn't this make things difficult for them?

22
00:00:47,110 --> 00:00:49,460
This is not realistic, Dad

23
00:00:49,460 --> 00:00:50,860
I seemed to hear a voice

24
00:00:50,860 --> 00:00:52,510
Hide, hide quickly

25
00:00:52,510 --> 00:00:55,510
Maybe the army of Lou opera people is arriving soon

26
00:00:57,940 --> 00:00:59,940
I am the father-in-law Xiao Zhengbei of Shazhou City.

27
00:00:59,940 --> 00:01:01,540
Are you heading to Shazhou City?
